Package: copland-os-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Copland OS project <anas1412@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/anas1412/copland-os
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: xfce4, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin, xfce4-terminal, xfce4-notifyd, adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-urw-base35, fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-dejavu-mono, gtk2-engines-murrine, libgtk-3-bin, python3, devilspie2, fastfetch
Recommends: xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter, plymouth, console-setup, grub-common
Description: Copland OS look for Debian XFCE (Serial Experiments Lain)
 Applies the Copland OS Enterprise look system-wide: GTK and window theme, Mac OS 9
 icons, classic Mac cursors, wallpaper, top bar, terminal colours, fastfetch, four
 named workspaces (layers) with per-app rules, keyboard shortcuts, login screen, boot
 animation, boot menu and console colours. Settings are installed as defaults, so
 every user can still change them. Built on upstream Debian @DEBIAN_VERSION@.
